SplatForge
Copyright 2026 SplatForge contributors

This distribution contains original SplatForge source and independently
expressed mathematical operators inspired by the papers listed in
provenance/surface_methods.json and the companion package's SPEC.md.

Optional integrations interoperate with gsplat, Copyright 2023 The Nerfstudio
Team and contributors, and the Mollylulu gsplat_radegs port. Their source and
binaries are not bundled. Preserve their applicable notices when installing
or redistributing those dependencies.

The companion's Unbiased Surfel mathematical method is attributed to Yixin
Yang, Yang Zhou, and Hui Huang, "Introducing Unbiased Depth into 2D Gaussian
Splatting for High-accuracy Surface Reconstruction", arXiv:2503.06587v3.
Its separate NOTICE and SOURCE_POLICY.md remain applicable.
